were not just products. They were instruments of transformation, helping

452
00:38:47.666 --> 00:38:52.417
to define Gulf's roles. A center for agricultural Advancement. And

453
00:38:52.417 --> 00:38:54.577
it speaks to the many individuals and families who have

454
00:38:54.577 --> 00:38:58.257
called this building home over the last century. Their lives,

455
00:38:58.257 --> 00:39:00.857
layered over time, have added new chapters to the building

456
00:39:00.857 --> 00:39:06.885
story, chapters of domestic life, community and adaptation. The structure

457
00:39:06.885 --> 00:39:09.565
is more than stone and mortar. It is a witness

458
00:39:09.565 --> 00:39:12.325
to the evolution of our city. And a reminder that

459
